# Class: obo:HMDM_0000074 (herbal medication and supplementation)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000074 "Products made from botanicals, or plants, that are used to treat diseases or to maintain health are called herbal products, botanical products, or phytomedicines. A product made from plants and used solely for internal use is called an herbal supplement.")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000074 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:HMDM_0000074 "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism_ontology")
