AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000092 "An enzyme that participates in a chemical reaction that removes a carboxyl group, decarboxylation, from a compound.")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000092 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
