# Class: obo:HMDM_0000099 (sulindac)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000099 "A monocarboxylic acid that is 1-benzylidene-1H-indene which is substituted at positions 2, 3, and 5 by methyl, carboxymethyl, and fluorine respectively, and in which the phenyl group of the benzylidene moiety is substituted at the para position by a methylsulfinyl group. It is a prodrug for the corresponding sulfide, a non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drug, used particularly in the treatment of acute and chronic inflammatory conditions. Sulindac is used to relieve pain, tenderness, swelling, and stiffness caused by osteoarthritis (arthritis caused by a breakdown of the lining of the joints), rheumatoid arthritis (arthritis caused by swelling of the lining of the joints), and ankylosing spondylitis (arthritis that mainly affects the spine).")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000099 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:HMDM_0000099 "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism_ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:HMDM_0000099 "HMDM:0000099")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:HMDM_0000099 "sulindac")
SubClassOf(obo:HMDM_0000099 obo:HMDM_0000002)

# Class: obo:HMDM_0000108 (raloxifene)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000108 "A member of the class of 1-benzothiophenes that is 1-benzothiophene in which the hydrogens at positions 2, 3, and 6 have been replaced by p-hydroxyphenyl, p-[2-(piperidin-1-yl)ethoxy]benzoyl, and hydroxy groups, respectively. Raloxifene is a medication used to prevent and treat osteoporosis in postmenopausal women and those on glucocorticoids. It is also used to reduce the risk of breast cancer in those at high risk. Raloxifene is a selective estrogen receptor modulator (SERM) and therefore a mixed agonist–antagonist of the estrogen receptor (ER). It has estrogenic effects in bone and antiestrogenic effects in the breasts and uterus.")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000108 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:HMDM_0000108 "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism_ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:HMDM_0000108 "HMDM:0000108")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:HMDM_0000108 "raloxifene")
SubClassOf(obo:HMDM_0000108 obo:HMDM_0000002)

