# Class: obo:HMDM_0000274 (sulfatase)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:15493058") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000274 "Sulfatases, which cleave sulfate esters in biological systems, play a key role in regulating the sulfation states that determine the function of many physiological molecules.")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000274 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
