AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:27654655") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000279 "Arylsulfatases are enzymes which catalyze the hydrolysis of arylsulfate ester bonds to release a free sulfonate.")
