AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:32158429") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000281 "Hormones are largely responsible for the integrated communication network responsible for modulating cellular signaling for protein synthesis. All aspects from production, release, transportation, and tissue uptake to intracellular signaling affect the cell signaling and communication that govern the basic activities of cells and coordinate all cellular actions.")
