AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:31209107") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:34260950") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000467 "Bacterial 20beta-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase (20beta-HSDH) is a NADH-dependent oxidoreductase belonging to the SDR family and is expressed by some strains of B. adolescentis and it regulates cortisol side-chain cleavage by reducing the C-20 carboxyl group on cortisol, yielding 20beta-dihydrocortisol.")
