AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000787 "It is a sedative phenothiazine with weak antipsychotic properties. It also has adrenolytic, anticholinergic, metabolic and endocrine effects, and an action on the extrapyramidal system.")
