AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:10825529") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:29392561") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000825 "Cyclomaltodextrinase (CDase) is a maltogenic amylase and neopullulanase are reported to be capable of hydrolyzing all or two of the following three types of substrates: cyclomaltodextrins (CDs); pullulan; and starch.")
