AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000847 "A chemical process that involves the removal of one or mole electrons from a molecular entity.")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000847 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
