# Class: obo:HMDM_0000934 (cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator (CFTR) potentiators)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:25811419") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:30616300") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000934 "The CFTR potentiators increase channel activity of the CFRT protein located at the cell surface and enhance ion transport. Ivacaftor is the first intervention that corrects the underlying molecular defect in CF. It has demonstrated effectiveness in people with a class III mutation (G551D) and some effectiveness with class IV mutations (R117H) and has the potential to be used for other class III and IV mutations.")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000934 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:HMDM_0000934 "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism_ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:HMDM_0000934 "HMDM:0000934")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:HMDM_0000934 "cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator (CFTR) potentiators")
SubClassOf(obo:HMDM_0000934 obo:HMDM_0000073)

